data: {"id": "867a3625883345a9-thinking-parallel_evidence-357", "run_id": "867a3625883345a9", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "- **实体身份**: `aiops-case-v01/workload`, UID `6743bbac-5908-452b-a35b-5f6327fe8a58`, 拥有容器 `app`。\n- **当前状态**: `Pending`, `nodeName: <none>`, 无 IP。\n- **异常类型**: `PendingUnschedulable`。\n- **直接原因**: Scheduler 事件明确报告 `0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu`，且 `0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found`。\n- **资源配置**: 容器 `app` 请求 `memory: 8Mi`，未请求 CPU (`requests.cpu` 缺失)，限制 `cpu: 100k`。\n- **其他检查**: 无 NodeSelectors，无 Taints 冲突，无 VolumeMounts，无 PVC 绑定问题。\n- **可观测性**: 日志 (empty)、Tracing (empt", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789104547202, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

