data: {"id": "867a3625883345a9-final", "run_id": "867a3625883345a9", "seq": 362, "ts_ms": 1789104560249, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v01/workload` | Pending | Pod 'workload' in 'aiops-case-v01' is stuck in Pending state. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedScheduling  55s   default-scheduler  0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu.` | 明确诊断调度失败的直接原因：集群所有节点均不满足 CPU 需求。 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `resource_request.cpu: 100k` (即 0.1 Core) | 提供被调度 Pod 的具体 CPU 需求数值，验证调度器报错中的 Insufficient cpu。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `PodScheduled=False, Unschedulable, 0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu.` | 持续确认 Pod 因资源不足被卡在 Pending 状态，且尝试抢占失败。 |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubernetes | `phase: Pending` | 确认 Pod 当前的生命周期阶段，表明调度失败尚未解决。 |\n\n**证据分析：**\nKubernetes Event (事实 1) 与 Pod 状态 (事实 3) 一致指出 \"Insufficient cpu\" 为直接原因。配置数据 (事实 2) 明确了资源申请的基数，证实调度器判定所有 3 个节点均无法提供所需的 CPU 资源。Logging 与 Tracing 维度因 Pod 未启动而无法提供额外信息，但 Kubernetes 层面已给出充分且闭环的证据。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n集群可用 CPU 资源耗尽 → 调度器无法匹配 Pod 的 100k CPU 请求 → 节点不足导致抢占尝试失败 → Pod 处于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因：**集群 CPU 资源不足 (Insufficient cpu)**。\n\n该结论由以下事实支撑：调度器 Event 明确指出 3 个可用节点均无法满足 Pod 的资源请求（`fact-e312ba7152a4`）；Pod 状态持续卡在 Pending，且调度器确认无可用抢占对象（`fact-1f40c2f9c5ca`）。现有证据链条完整，足以解释 Pod 无法调度的现象。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 52.1s\n├─ 问题定位: 15.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 29.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v01/workload: 29.1s (Evidence 23.4s, RCA 5.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v01/workload**: pod-pending-unschedulable, pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 52.067, "metrics": {"run_id": "867a3625883345a9", "mttr": {"value": "52.1s", "seconds": 52.086297273635864, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "45%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 52086.297273635864, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 47801.97024345398, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 11274.61838722229, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3927.523374557495}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 15626.421928405762, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 29080.816507339478, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 7346.0874